data: {"id": "7b794c247382491f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1780", "run_id": "7b794c247382491f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的关键事实如下：\n\n- **Pod身份与生命周期**：namespace `aiops-case-06`，Pod名 `workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c`，UID `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`。当前状态为 `Running`（kubelet侧），但容器状态 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数 21，最近一次重启 22 秒前。Ready 条件为 `False`。\n- **容器配置**：container `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，启动命令 `command: [\"python3\", \"/opt/aiops/server.py\"]`。\n- **退出码**：`exitCode=2`，这是 shell/程序错误返回码，通常表示脚本执行失败或命令行参数解析错误。\n- **日志证据（当前 + 前次崩溃）**：两者完全一致，关键日志为 `{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"me", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788441622268, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

