=2) → K8s 检测到容器退出并重启 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用在处理 HTTP `/work` 接口时发生运行期逻辑错误（Runtime logic error），导致进程直接终止（退出码 2）并抛出 HTTP 500。\n\n该根因由以下事实支撑：\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**：容器 `app` 频繁重启，处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，且上一次终止原因为 `Error`，退出码确认为 `2` (证据1, 7, 8)。\n2. **应用日志与链路**：应用日志和 Tracing 均显示，当访问 `/work` 接口时，服务返回 HTTP 500 并触发 \"runtime process exiting\"，随后进程结束 (证据3, 4, 5)。\n3. **排除资源限制**：虽然容器内存限制仅为 96Mi，但日志中 `numeric_fields` 显示 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0.0，且进程退出码为 2 而非 OOM 常见的 137，表明崩溃由逻辑错误引起而非内存超限。\n\n**未知部分**：具体的代码缺陷或缺失的依赖库导致 `/work` 报错的具体代码路径，因缺乏 Traceback 堆栈信息而未能确定 (见诊断中的 `unknowns`)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 31.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 66.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 66.6s (Evidence 57.7s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 113.327, "metrics": {"run_id": "7b794c247382491f", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 113.3460922241211, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 113346.0922241211, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 107689.48483467102, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 13533.333539962769, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5170.228719711304}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 31139.885663986206, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 66643.03827285767, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 15522.801399230957, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

